{"2317790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Titan: The Ascension", "steam_appid": 2317790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titan: The Ascension is a colony management and survival strategy game set on Saturn’s moon Titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of a corporation tasked with establishing humanity’s first large-scale off-world colony while Earth is collapsing due to extreme water shortages caused by climate change and global conflict. Your mission is not only survival on Titan, but also supporting Earth’s remaining population through resource extraction and interplanetary trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/1d315dd9d351ad33bd70e574094cb221.avif?t=1776782044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras_big/1d315dd9d351ad33bd70e574094cb221.avif?t=1776782044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earth–Titan Resource Network</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Titan, you will explore the frozen northern regions of the moon to locate and extract valuable ice deposits hidden beneath the surface. These resources are mined, processed, and converted into usable water, forming the core of a critical supply chain that connects Titan to Earth. The extracted water is transported across space to support Earth’s collapsing infrastructure and remaining population, where resource scarcity has reached extreme levels. In exchange, Earth provides financial credits, raw materials, and advanced technological components that are essential for expanding, upgrading, and maintaining your growing colony on Titan. This interplanetary exchange system becomes the foundation of your progression, driving both survival and expansion as you balance extraction efficiency with colony development needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/0e59ecf27f9045b0c437171a42602c48.avif?t=1776782044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras_big/0e59ecf27f9045b0c437171a42602c48.webp?t=1776782044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colony Infrastructure and Industrial Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will design and expand a large industrial network across the frozen surface of Titan, building the systems needed to support a growing off-world operation. This includes managing production chains, establishing efficient logistics routes, and connecting multiple facilities into a functioning economy. Before permanent human habitation is possible, you must construct essential resource processing systems, stabilize supply lines, and prepare the groundwork for future dome-based colonist housing. Every structure you build plays a role in transforming a hostile environment into a sustainable colony capable of long-term survival and expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/f1731ca8b68f84231cb9d6a78fbc5744.avif?t=1776782044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras_big/f1731ca8b68f84231cb9d6a78fbc5744.avif?t=1776782044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Threats and Colony Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your presence on Titan grows, you will uncover remnants of an ancient automated system buried beneath the surface. These dormant machines are not passive. Their core directive is to eliminate all technological activity on Titan. As your colony advances, these systems begin to awaken and actively target your infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must defend your expanding colony using tactical defense systems, including orbital support, automated weapons, and strategic planning to survive escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.poster.avif?t=1776782044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.webm?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.mp4?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colony building and industrial expansion on Titan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource extraction of ice and water conversion systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interplanetary trade between Earth and Titan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logistics and supply chain management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive base development from outpost to full colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive gameplay against hostile ancient automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival under environmental and technological threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titan: The Ascension combines large-scale colony planning with survival pressure, resource economy, and defensive strategy in a hostile off-world environment. You must carefully balance expansion, production efficiency, and resource distribution while adapting to an unforgiving alien landscape. Every decision impacts the stability of your colony, from industrial growth and supply chains to defense readiness and long-term sustainability. As your operation expands, new threats emerge and systems become more complex, requiring strategic planning and constant adaptation to ensure survival and continued progress on Titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.poster.avif?t=1776782044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.webm?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.mp4?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titan: The Ascension is a colony management and survival strategy game set on Saturn’s moon Titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of a corporation tasked with establishing humanity’s first large-scale off-world colony while Earth is collapsing due to extreme water shortages caused by climate change and global conflict. Your mission is not only survival on Titan, but also supporting Earth’s remaining population through resource extraction and interplanetary trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/1d315dd9d351ad33bd70e574094cb221.avif?t=1776782044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras_big/1d315dd9d351ad33bd70e574094cb221.avif?t=1776782044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earth–Titan Resource Network</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Titan, you will explore the frozen northern r