_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/f1731ca8b68f84231cb9d6a78fbc5744.avif?t=1776782044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras_big/f1731ca8b68f84231cb9d6a78fbc5744.avif?t=1776782044 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Threats and Colony Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your presence on Titan grows, you will uncover remnants of an ancient automated system buried beneath the surface. These dormant machines are not passive. Their core directive is to eliminate all technological activity on Titan. As your colony advances, these systems begin to awaken and actively target your infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must defend your expanding colony using tactical defense systems, including orbital support, automated weapons, and strategic planning to survive escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.poster.avif?t=1776782044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.webm?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/afa194581289d8aaf0c69f7376d66c71.mp4?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colony building and industrial expansion on Titan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource extraction of ice and water conversion systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interplanetary trade between Earth and Titan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logistics and supply chain management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive base development from outpost to full colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive gameplay against hostile ancient automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival under environmental and technological threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titan: The Ascension combines large-scale colony planning with survival pressure, resource economy, and defensive strategy in a hostile off-world environment. You must carefully balance expansion, production efficiency, and resource distribution while adapting to an unforgiving alien landscape. Every decision impacts the stability of your colony, from industrial growth and supply chains to defense readiness and long-term sustainability. As your operation expands, new threats emerge and systems become more complex, requiring strategic planning and constant adaptation to ensure survival and continued progress on Titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.poster.avif?t=1776782044\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.webm?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317790/extras/473d282be2131709983f8095fda5d9a4.mp4?t=1776782044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Titan: The Ascension is a colony management strategy game on Saturn’s moon Titan. Build and expand an off-world industrial colony, extract ice to produce water for Earth, trade resources, and defend against ancient automated systems that react to technology growth. Will you prevail?", "supported